/*!
\page page_steventsummary StEventSummary

\brief Aggregate event-level quantities: multiplicities, mean kinematics, vertex position, binned distributions.

\section steventsummary_overview Overview
\c StEventSummary collects event-level quantities computed during reconstruction:
track multiplicities (total, good, primary, positive, negative, exotic, pile-up),
mean kinematic variables (⟨p_T⟩, ⟨p_T²⟩, ⟨η⟩, RMS η), the primary vertex position,
and binned histograms of tracks and calorimeter energy in η, φ, and p_T.

\section steventsummary_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StEventSummary
\endcode

\section steventsummary_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Int_t | mNumberOfTracks | Total reconstructed tracks |
| Int_t | mNumberOfGoodTracks | Tracks passing quality cuts |
| Int_t | mNumberOfGoodPrimaryTracks | Good primary tracks at primary vertex |
| Int_t | mNumberOfPositiveTracks | Positively charged good tracks |
| Int_t | mNumberOfNegativeTracks | Negatively charged good tracks |
| Int_t | mNumberOfExoticTracks | Exotic/secondary tracks (V0, kink) |
| Int_t | mNumberOfVertices | Total reconstructed vertices |
| TArrayL | mNumberOfVertexTypes | Counts by StVertexId enum |
| Int_t | mNumberOfPileupVertices | Pile-up vertex count |
| Float_t | mMeanPt | Mean p_T (GeV/c) |
| Float_t | mMeanPt2 | Mean p²_T (GeV²/c²) |
| Float_t | mMeanEta | Mean pseudorapidity |
| Float_t | mRmsEta | RMS pseudorapidity |
| StThreeVectorF | mPrimaryVertexPos | Primary vertex (cm) |
| Double_t | mMagneticFieldZ | Magnetic field along z (kGauss) |
| TArrayF | mEtaBins / mPtBins / mPhiBins | Histogram bin edges |
| TArrayL | mEtaOfTracksHisto / mPtOfTracksHisto / mPhiOfTracksHisto | Track counts per bin |
| TArrayF | mEneryVsEtaHisto / mEnergyVsPhiHisto | Energy per bin |

\section steventsummary_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `int numberOfTracks() const` | Total reconstructed tracks |
| `int numberOfGoodTracks() const` | Tracks passing quality cuts |
| `int numberOfGoodTracks(StChargeSign) const` | Good tracks by charge sign |
| `float meanPt() const` | Mean p_T (GeV/c) |
| `float meanPt2() const` | Mean p²_T (GeV²/c²) |
| `float meanEta() const` | Mean pseudorapidity |
| `float rmsEta() const` | RMS pseudorapidity |
| `StThreeVectorF primaryVertexPosition() const` | Primary vertex (cm) |
| `double magneticField() const` | B along z (kGauss) |
| `unsigned int numberOfBins() const` | Histogram bin count |
| `long tracksInEtaBin(int i) const` | Track count in η bin i |
| `float energyInEtaBin(int i) const` | Energy deposit in η bin i |

\section steventsummary_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEventSummary* sum = event->summary();
cout << "Good tracks: "  << sum->numberOfGoodTracks() << endl;
cout << "<pT> = "        << sum->meanPt()  << " GeV/c" << endl;
cout << "Vertex z = "    << sum->primaryVertexPosition().z() << " cm" << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_steventinfo
\see \ref page_struninfo
*/
